- [S3] STC15 failed: Every variable used in a guard must be formally defined. | Guard `v1 = 'Referee Reports not completed'` on `b1 -> n4` uses undefined variable `v1`. | Guard `v2 = 'Referee Reports still not completed after second check'` on `b2 -> n4` uses undefined variable `v2`. | DSL: guard(b1,n4,"v1 = 'Referee Reports not completed'"); guard(b2,n4,"v2 = 'Referee Reports still not completed after second check'")
- [S4] STC16 failed: Every outgoing edge of XOR/OR branches must have exactly one guard. | XOR/OR edge `b1 -> c1` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b2 -> c1` has 0 guards; exactly one is required. | XOR/OR edge `b3 -> n13` has 0 guards; exactly one is required.

